<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Ask, and it shall be given unto you;</l><l>Seek, and you shall find.</l><l>Knock, and it shall be opened unto you.</l><l>Hallelu, Hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Man shall not live by bread alone,</l><l>But by every word</l><l>That proceeds out from the mouth of God.</l><l>Hallelu, Hallelujah!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
